    {
      "id": "why",
      "x": 2320,
      "y": 0,
      "w": 300,
      "page": "page-1",
      "text": "Second balance pass, pushed further.\n\nType 19.5, stars 19, waves down to 72 (88 unbeaded).\n\nThe governing ratio is the type band depth against the centre width: 9.7 vs 79 at the start, 12.2 vs 76 after the first pass, 14 vs 68 now. The ring has gone from caption to the loudest thing in the mark.\n\nOptions A and B take one more step in the same direction if this is still short."
    },
    {
      "id": "history",
      "x": 3700,
      "y": 0,
      "w": 280,
      "page": "page-2",
      "text": "Everything earlier, kept for the record. The beaded stamp on page one came out of these."
    }
